{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23517","headline":"闲出觅春戏赠诸郎官 · 白居易","name":"闲出觅春戏赠诸郎官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"年来数出觅风光，亦不全闲亦不忙。\n放鞚体安骑稳马，隔袍身暖照晴阳。\n迎春日日添诗思，送老时时放酒狂。\n除却髭须白一色，其余未伏少年郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23517.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23517","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}